Chapter: BvtMountedSwing
  cites Uoaix chapter GameClientView
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 D-22 (Damian, 2026-10-13): a rider's swing is drawn as the mounted swing, never an on-foot action that unhorses him.
  bvt-mounted-swing : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-mounted-swing (unused) = act
    a <- bvt-check "a rider's one-handed swings draw 26, two-handed 29, bow 27, crossbow 28 (ServUO PlaySwingAnimation mounted)" (gcv-mounted-action 9 == 26 & gcv-mounted-action 12 == 26 & gcv-mounted-action 13 == 29 & gcv-mounted-action 18 == 27 & gcv-mounted-action 19 == 28 & gcv-mounted-action 26 == 26)
    b <- bvt-check "a rider's hurt flinch and cast gestures are dropped, not drawn on foot" (gcv-mounted-action 20 < 0 & gcv-mounted-action 16 < 0 & gcv-mounted-action 17 < 0 & gcv-mounted-action 32 < 0)
    a + b
  end
